{%- comment -%}
  Icons: Font Awesome Free (fa-regular comments/envelope, fa-brands whatsapp/x-twitter/linkedin/
  markdown, fa-solid link) — same icon set used on senthilnayagan.net's shareAndComment.html,
  inlined as SVGs rather than loading the whole Font Awesome kit for seven icons.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign shareUrl = page.url | toAbsoluteUrl -%}
<div class="post__share">
